(equinoctial fury, a precarious stage-setting, ready to be blown down at) Tj T*
(the first gusts from the north. A forlorn bird here and there made a thin) Tj T*
(piping, as it flitted homelessly amid the bleached long grasses, and the) Tj T*
(frail silk of the milkweed pods came floating along ghostlike on the) Tj T*
