() Tj T*
(THE GREEN FRIEND) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Though we had received such unmistakable notice to quit, we still) Tj T*
(lingered on in our solitude, after the manner of defiant tenants whom) Tj T*
(nothing short of corporal ejection can dislodge. The North wind began to) Tj T*
(roar in the tree-tops and shake the doors and windows of the shack, like) Tj T*
