() Tj T*
("Something of a walk, old man.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
("All the better. We shall be all the longer getting there. But, listen.) Tj T*
(To go by train would be almost too sudden a shock. I don't believe we) Tj T*
(could stand it. To be here to-day, breathing this God's fresh air, living) Tj T*
(the lives of natural men in a natural world, and to-morrow--Broadway, the) Tj T*
(horrible crowds, the hustle, the dirt, the smells, the uproar.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
