(conversation, and we listened with a great gladness.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Yes! who would think that this little, quiet, mill-race is on her way to) Tj T*
(the Gulf of Mexico!") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We looked at the little reeded river, so demure in her morning mists, so) Tj T*
